<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= work.title %> | Văn Hay</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #fbfaf8; }
        .font-serif { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }
        .work-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.9; color: #374151; font-size: 1.125rem; }
        .work-content h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: #431407; line-height: 1.3; }
        .work-content h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #78350f; }
        .work-content strong { color: #111827; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-stone-900">
    <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 no-underline">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#431407] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-2xl shadow-md">V</div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif tracking-tight text-stone-900">Văn Hay</h1>
            </a>
            
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-6">
                <% menu.forEach(item => { %>
                    <a href="<%= item.href %>" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-amber-900 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors no-underline"><%= item.name %></a>
                <% }) %>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center bg-stone-100 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-stone-200">
                <span class="mr-2 opacity-50">🔍</span>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Tìm kiếm..." class="bg-transparent border-none text-sm outline-none w-32 md:w-48">
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <aside class="hidden lg:block space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-black text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-6">Chuyên mục</h2>
            <% menu.forEach(item => { %>
                <a href="<%= item.href %>" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-amber-50 hover:text-amber-900 font-bold transition-all text-stone-600 no-underline">
                    <span class="text-xl opacity-70"><%= item.icon %></span>
                    <%= item.name %>
                </a>
            <% }) %>

            <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-amber-900 rounded-[2.5rem] text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 uppercase mb-2">Trợ lý AI</p>
                <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold mb-4">Bạn cần tìm hiểu thêm?</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-amber-100/70 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Hãy để AI Lạc giải đáp mọi thắc mắc về điển tích, nhân vật và ý nghĩa văn học.</p>
                <button class="w-full bg-white text-amber-900 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm">Hỏi ngay</button>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Article Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-3">
            <article class="bg-white rounded-[3rem] border border-stone-200 shadow-sm p-8 md:p-16">
                <header class="mb-12 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-full text-[10px] font-black mb-6 tracking-widest uppercase"><%= work.category %></span>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 leading-[1.1] mb-8 tracking-tight italic"><%= work.title %></h1>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 text-stone-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border-y border-stone-100 py-4">
                        <span>Tác giả: <%= work.author %></span>
                        <span class="w-1 h-1 bg-stone-200 rounded-full"></span>
                        <span><%= work.views %> lượt xem</span>
                    </div>
                </header>

                <% if (work.thumbnail) { %>
                    <div class="mb-16 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                        <img src="<%= work.thumbnail %>" alt="<%= work.title %>" class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-video">
                    </div>
                <% } %>

                <div class="work-content prose prose-stone lg:prose-xl max-w-none">
                    <%- work.content %>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-stone-100">
                    <div class="bg-[#fbfaf8] p-10 md:p-14 rounded-[3rem] border border-stone-200 relative">
                        <div class="absolute -top-6 left-12 w-12 h-12 bg-amber-900 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl shadow-lg">✨</div>
                        <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-3xl mb-6 text-stone-900">Lời bình từ AI Lạc</h4>
                        <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-lg italic">"Câu chuyện này là minh chứng cho trí tuệ và tâm hồn người Việt. Qua từng con chữ được biên tập lại, Văn Hay hy vọng mang đến cho bạn một góc nhìn mới mẻ, trân trọng những giá trị truyền thống nhưng vẫn đầy hơi thở hiện đại."</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <% if (work.tags && work.tags.length > 0) { %>
                    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <% work.tags.forEach(tag => { %>
                            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-500 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">#<%= tag %></span>
                        <% }) %>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </article>

            <!-- Related Posts -->
            <section class="mt-20">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-8 text-stone-800">Cùng chuyên mục</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    <% related.forEach(item => { %>
                        <a href="/<%= item.slug %>" class="group flex gap-4 bg-white p-4 rounded-3xl border border-stone-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all no-underline">
                            <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-stone-100">
                                <img src="<%= item.thumbnail %>" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" onerror="this.src='https://picsum.photos/200/200'">
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
                                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-stone-800 line-clamp-2 group-hover:text-amber-900"><%= item.title %></h4>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-400 mt-2"><%= item.author %></span>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-stone-900 text-stone-500 py-20 mt-20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Văn Hay</h2>
            <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-amber-900 mx-auto mb-10"></div>
            <p class="max-w-md mx-auto mb-12 text-stone-400 leading-relaxed italic">"Văn học là nhân học. Lưu giữ hồn Việt qua từng con chữ được mài giũa bởi trí tuệ nhân tạo."</p>
            <div class="flex justify-center gap-8 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-12">
                <a href="/truyen-co-tich" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cổ tích</a>
                <a href="/truyen-ngu-ngon" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Ngụ ngôn</a>
                <a href="/tho-cho-be" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Thơ ca</a>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-10 border-t border-stone-800 text-[10px] opacity-30 uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">
                © 2026 Văn Hay. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
